          "Flow 1 (Pre-Trade Reservation & Deterministic Replay): When a user places a Buy Limit Order for 100 shares of `AAPL` at `$200.00`, the Risk Engine atomically checks `availableCash >= $20,000` and moves `$20,000` into `reservedCash`. The command is appended to the symbol shard's Raft log with `seqNo = 984120`. If the order later fills at a better price (say `$199.50` via price improvement), the Post-Trade Execution handler releases the `$50.00` price improvement back to `availableCash`.",
