        heading: "5. High-Level Box Diagram",
        body: "The architecture follows the modern **Cortex / Thanos / Grafana Mimir & Loki** split: stateless Distributors validate and hash incoming batches; Ingesters buffer the latest 2 hours in a disk-backed Write-Ahead Log (WAL) and Gorilla memory chunks before flushing immutable blocks to S3; and Queriers federate real-time RAM state with historical S3 blocks.",
